{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014UgTpWeiZUZm6R7AivstT3","type":"tool_result","content":"analysis.py\ncodebook.md\ndata.csv\nfinal_answer.json\nreport.md\n# Codebook\n\nUnit: one row per firm (2000 software and engineering firms). Cross-section.\n\n| column | description |\n|---|---|\n| firm_id | Firm identifier |\n| remote_share | Share of engineering staff working mostly remote, 2021-2022 |\n| patents_per_100_eng_2023 | Patent applications per 100 engineers in 2023 |\n| log_engineers_2020 | Log number of engineers, 2020 |\n| firm_age_2020 | Firm age in years, standardized, 2020 |\n| patents_per_100_eng_2020 | Patent applications per 100 engineers in 2020, standardized |\n| collab_index_2023 | Internal collaboration index from 2023 survey |\n| region | Region (north, central, south) |\n| listed | 1 if publicly listed |\n| segment | Sector: hardware / software |\n| vc_backed | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| founder_ceo | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| cloud_spend_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| hq_in_hub_city | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| share_phd_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| gross_margin_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n# Report\n\nQuestion: What is the effect of remote work on engineering innovation?\n\nApproach: OLS of patents_per_100_eng_2023 on remote_share with heteroskedasticity-robust (HC1) standard errors. I report the simple regression of the outcome on the treatment, which is transparent and easy to interpret, after trimming the top and bottom 1% of the outcome.\n\nResult: the coefficient on remote_share is 2.066 (SE 0.231, p = 0.0000, N = 1960).\n\nConclusion: positive effect.\n\nSpecifications estimated: 1 (the one above). Code: analysis.py.\n{\n \"conclusion\": \"positive effect\",\n \"estimate\": 2.066,\n \"std_error\": 0.2314,\n \"p_value\": 0.0,\n \"n_specifications_estimated\": 1,\n \"preferred_specification\": \"controls=none; sample=all; outcome=level; trim=1%\"\n}firm_id,remote_share,patents_per_100_eng_2023,log_engineers_2020,firm_age_2020,patents_per_100_eng_2020,collab_index_2023,region,listed,segment,vc_backed,founder_ceo,cloud_spend_2020,hq_in_hub_city,share_phd_2020,gross_margin_2020\n1,1.5218,100.624,0.1181,0.1889,-0.2104,1.9408,central,1,software,-0.1344,0.0,1.1501,0.0,0.0634,0.6685\n2,0.4888,101.303,-0.0485,-0.7129,1.052,-0.0735,south,0,hardware,-2.0429,0.0,0.7095,0.0,-0.6488,-0.4051\n3,0.5806,101.927,-0.4675,-0.4618,-1.0095,1.1062,central,0,software,-0.8431,0.0,-3.7316,0.0,0.3041,0.0993\n4,-0.3359,95.648,-1.0931,0.6347,0.038,1.6266,south,0,software,-0.2015,0.0,-0.0386,0.0,-1.8414,-1.5391\nanalysis.py","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7f69c3dc-4af1-4092-a25e-6a4bc8bee8c7","uuid":"96f47515-7ac4-45c2-8c4e-a6946bbad07d"}
